{"id": "gsm8k:137", "benchmark": "gsm8k", "started_unix": 1790750364.9453497, "first_event_seconds": 0.8838012659689412, "wall_seconds": 13.086340678972192, "prompt_sha256": "907c641845585cad277c09929aae72e8e62ffbda5dfefa5d2ffabace4e84961f", "prompt_tokens": 124, "max_new_tokens": 512, "completion_tokens": 261, "finish_reason": {"type": "stop", "matched": 151645}, "request_id": "aaf2318cc79f4e949cd5dacbd91afeef", "text": "Step 1: Calculate the cost of the subs.\n2 subs * $7.50 each = $15.00\n\nStep 2: Calculate the cost of the bags of chips.\n2 bags * $1.50 each = $3.00\n\nStep 3: Calculate the cost of the cookies.\n2 cookies * $1.00 each = $2.00\n\nStep 4: Calculate the subtotal before fees and tip.\n$15.00 (subs) + $3.00 (chips) + $2.00 (cookies) = $20.00\n\nStep 5: Calculate the delivery fee (20% of the subtotal).\n20% of $20.00 = 0.20 * $20.00 = $4.00\n\nStep 6: Calculate the total cost including the delivery fee.\n$20.00 (subtotal) + $4.00 (delivery fee) = $24.00\n\nStep 7: Add the tip.\n$24.00 (total with delivery fee) + $5.00 (tip) = $29.00\n\nFinal: 29", "final_answer": "29", "gold_answer": "29", "gsm_numeric_answer": "29", "gsm_extraction": "FINAL", "truncated": false, "events": 261, "entry_transfer_id": "4b2b65f8-1db4-4dc2-9c7c-57b33ee2f0d5", "completed_entry_released": true, "cleanup_seconds": 0.003334983019158244, "arm": "full", "dataset_sha256": "5591e964da8fd457f0e113d82330c84c94e6074b1ad80d1ee414dca751d893c3"}
